    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alerts by priority\n- **P1 HOLD** (duplicate, bank change, bad data): instant Telegram, facts only, no AI\n- **P2 REVIEW**: Gemini writes a 2-sentence explanation; a **guardrail** rejects any text that claims approval/payment, names another status or asks for bank details; the note is written back to the ledger row; then Telegram\n- **P3 READY**: no message (avoids alert fatigue); counted in the daily digest",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "name": "About this sub-workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -120
      ]
